> # Phase 2 checkpoint: orders rest on the book. Nothing matches yet.
> ADD BUY 100 @ 100.02
ACK #1 DEMO BUY 100 @ 100.02 GTC
> ADD BUY 200 @ 100.02
ACK #2 DEMO BUY 200 @ 100.02 GTC
> ADD BUY 150 @ 100.01
ACK #3 DEMO BUY 150 @ 100.01 GTC
> ADD SELL 200 @ 100.05
ACK #4 DEMO SELL 200 @ 100.05 GTC
> ADD SELL 500 @ 100.06
ACK #5 DEMO SELL 500 @ 100.06 GTC
> BOOK
DEMO  orders: 5  bid levels: 2  ask levels: 2
  side       price         qty  orders
   ASK      100.06         500       1
   ASK      100.05         200       1
--------------------------------------  spread 0.03
   BID      100.02         300       2
   BID      100.01         150       1

> # Cancelling removes an order; a second cancel finds nothing.
> CANCEL 2
CANCELLED #2 DEMO BUY 200 @ 100.02 GTC
> CANCEL 2
ERROR no resting order with id 2

> # Bad input is rejected before it reaches the book.
> ADD BUY 0 @ 100.00
REJECT invalid quantity
> ADD BUY 5000000000 @ 100.00
REJECT quantity above maximum
> ADD BUY 10 @ 100.001
ERROR invalid price "100.001"
> ADD HOLD 10 @ 100.00
ERROR side must be BUY or SELL, not "HOLD"
> CANCEL abc
ERROR usage: CANCEL <id>
> FLY 10
ERROR unknown command "FLY" (try HELP)

> # Without matching, a buy above the best ask just rests: the book is crossed.
> ADD BUY 50 @ 100.07
ACK #6 DEMO BUY 50 @ 100.07 GTC
> BOOK 1
DEMO  orders: 5  bid levels: 3  ask levels: 2
  side       price         qty  orders
   ASK      100.05         200       1
--------------------------------------  spread -0.02 (crossed)
   BID      100.07          50       1
